+## Multiplicative dressing: the first genuine BB iteration
+
+Summing a raw diagonal, algebraically writing (Y_0[1+lambda^2Y_1/Y_0]),
+and rebuilding perturbation theory with (Y_0) in the zeroth approximation
+are logically distinct.  The third operation starts from (Y=Y_0Z).  If
